SUMMARY:Beginning Wheel Spinning with Nelly DeVault
DESCRIPTION:September 19\, 2026\, 1:00-4:00 PM \nIn this class\, students will begin by learning the basics of spinning wheel function and will leave with their own hand-spun yarn!  This class is designed for new beginners\, but any spinners are welcome\, whether you can’t get along with your wheel or want help trouble-shooting any specific spinning issues.  Spinning fibers will be provided.  Please indicate when registering if you will bring your own wheel or borrow one. \nREGISTRATION CLOSED \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/beginning-wheel-spinning-with-nelly-devault-2
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
END:VEVENT
